  lines:
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon, the Dragonslayer, the Liberator, the
      Great Wizard
    text: Okay...okay! Calm down a sec! *Huff...huff*
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon, the Dragonslayer, the Liberator, the
      Great Wizard
    text: WHY ARE WE FIGHTING? *Huff...huff* DON'T YOU *huff...huff* WANNA GO HOME???
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon, the Dragonslayer, the Liberator, the
      Great Wizard
    text: WHY ARE YOU DOING THIS TO ME, WHY???
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon, the Dragonslayer, the Liberator, the
      Great Wizard
    text: LET ME GO!!!
